K3Surfaces -- construction of explicit examples of K3 surfaces
**************************************************************

Description
===========

This package is for constructing explicit examples of K3 surfaces.

References
==========

  * M. H. and G. S., Explicit constructions of K3 surfaces and unirational
    Noether-Lefschetz divisors, available at arXiv:2110.15819 (see
    https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.15819 ) (2021).

Authors
=======

  * Michael Hoff <hahn@math.uni-sb.de>
  * Giovanni Staglianò <giovanni.stagliano@unict.it>

Version
=======

This documentation describes version 1.1 of K3Surfaces, released August 13,
2022.

